---
import CodeBlock from '../CodeBlock.astro';
import Callout from '../Callout.astro';
import DocSection from '../DocSection.astro';
import DocImage from '../DocImage.astro';
import DocList from '../DocList.astro';
---

<article class="doc-article">
  <h1 class="doc-article__title">Agents in Containers</h1>

  <p class="doc-article__intro">
    Guía para containerizar agentes de IA autónomos. Cubre la arquitectura
    de un agente como microservicio, comunicación via mensajería, persistencia
    de estado, health checks y escalado horizontal en Kubernetes.
  </p>

  <!-- Agent Architecture -->
  <section id="agent-architecture">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Agent Architecture</h2>
    <p>
      Un agente de IA en producción es un <strong>microservicio</strong> que recibe
      tareas, razona, ejecuta tools y devuelve resultados. Al containerizarlo,
      lo tratamos como cualquier otro servicio: desplegable, escalable y observable.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="text">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment">Arquitectura de un agente containerizado</span>

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    <span class="token-func">Agent Container</span>                        │
│                                                          │
│  ┌────────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  │
│  │  <span class="token-string">Agent Core</span>    │  │ <span class="token-string">Tool Registry</span>│  │ <span class="token-string">Memory/State</span>│  │
│  │  (reasoning)   │  │              │  │             │  │
│  │  LLM calls     │  │  - Search    │  │  - Redis    │  │
│  │  Planning      │  │  - SQL Query │  │  - SQLite   │  │
│  │  Execution     │  │  - API Call  │  │  - Files    │  │
│  └───────┬────────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬──────┘  │
│          │                  │                  │         │
│  ┌───────▼──────────────────▼──────────────────▼──────┐  │
│  │              <span class="token-keyword">FastAPI / gRPC Server</span>                  │  │
│  │         /task    /status    /health                 │  │
│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                           │
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          │                │                │
     ┌────▼─────┐   ┌─────▼────┐   ┌──────▼──────┐
     │ <span class="token-string">RabbitMQ</span> │   │ <span class="token-string">LLM API</span>  │   │ <span class="token-string">PostgreSQL</span> │
     │ (tasks)  │   │(OpenAI/  │   │  (results)  │
     │          │   │ Ollama)  │   │             │
     └──────────┘   └──────────┘   └─────────────┘`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Containerizing an Agent -->
  <section id="containerizing-agent">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Containerizing an Agent</h2>
    <p>
      El Dockerfile del agente incluye el runtime de Python, las dependencias del framework
      de agentes, y configura un servidor HTTP para recibir tareas.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="dockerfile">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment"># Dockerfile para un agente de IA</span>
<span class="token-keyword">FROM</span> python:3.12-slim <span class="token-keyword">AS</span> base

<span class="token-keyword">ENV</span> PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
<span class="token-keyword">ENV</span> PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1

<span class="token-keyword">WORKDIR</span> /agent

<span class="token-comment"># Copiar dependencies primero (cache-friendly)</span>
<span class="token-keyword">COPY</span> requirements.txt .
<span class="token-keyword">RUN</span> pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt

<span class="token-comment"># Copiar código del agente</span>
<span class="token-keyword">COPY</span> . .

<span class="token-comment"># Crear usuario no-root</span>
<span class="token-keyword">RUN</span> useradd -r agent && chown -R agent:agent /agent
<span class="token-keyword">USER</span> agent

<span class="token-keyword">EXPOSE</span> 8080

<span class="token-keyword">HEALTHCHECK</span> --interval=30s --timeout=5s \\
  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || exit 1

<span class="token-keyword">CMD</span> ["uvicorn", "agent.server:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8080"]`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <h3 class="doc-article__h3">Servidor del agente</h3>
    <CodeBlock lang="python">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment"># agent/server.py</span>
<span class="token-keyword">import</span> asyncio
<span class="token-keyword">from</span> fastapi <span class="token-keyword">import</span> FastAPI, BackgroundTasks
<span class="token-keyword">from</span> pydantic <span class="token-keyword">import</span> BaseModel
<span class="token-keyword">from</span> agent.core <span class="token-keyword">import</span> AgentRunner

app = <span class="token-func">FastAPI</span>(title=<span class="token-string">"AI Agent Service"</span>)
runner = <span class="token-func">AgentRunner</span>()

<span class="token-keyword">class</span> <span class="token-func">TaskRequest</span>(BaseModel):
    task_id: <span class="token-keyword">str</span>
    prompt: <span class="token-keyword">str</span>
    context: <span class="token-keyword">dict</span> = {}
    max_iterations: <span class="token-keyword">int</span> = <span class="token-string">10</span>

<span class="token-keyword">class</span> <span class="token-func">TaskResponse</span>(BaseModel):
    task_id: <span class="token-keyword">str</span>
    status: <span class="token-keyword">str</span>
    result: <span class="token-keyword">str</span> | None = None

@app.<span class="token-func">post</span>(<span class="token-string">"/task"</span>, response_model=TaskResponse)
<span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">submit_task</span>(req: TaskRequest, bg: BackgroundTasks):
    <span class="token-string">"""Enviar tarea al agente (async, devuelve inmediatamente)."""</span>
    bg.<span class="token-func">add_task</span>(runner.execute, req.task_id, req.prompt, req.context)
    <span class="token-keyword">return</span> <span class="token-func">TaskResponse</span>(task_id=req.task_id, status=<span class="token-string">"accepted"</span>)

@app.<span class="token-func">get</span>(<span class="token-string">"/task/{task_id}"</span>)
<span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">get_task_status</span>(task_id: <span class="token-keyword">str</span>):
    <span class="token-keyword">return</span> runner.<span class="token-func">get_status</span>(task_id)

@app.<span class="token-func">get</span>(<span class="token-string">"/health"</span>)
<span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">health</span>():
    <span class="token-keyword">return</span> {<span class="token-string">"status"</span>: <span class="token-string">"healthy"</span>, <span class="token-string">"agent"</span>: runner.name}`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Message-driven Communication -->
  <section id="message-driven">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Message-driven Communication</h2>
    <p>
      Para sistemas multi-agente, la comunicación por colas de mensajes (RabbitMQ, Redis Streams)
      desacopla los agentes y permite escalado independiente.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="python">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment"># agent/consumer.py — Consumir tareas desde RabbitMQ</span>
<span class="token-keyword">import</span> aio_pika
<span class="token-keyword">import</span> json
<span class="token-keyword">from</span> agent.core <span class="token-keyword">import</span> AgentRunner

<span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">start_consumer</span>():
    connection = <span class="token-keyword">await</span> aio_pika.<span class="token-func">connect_robust</span>(
        <span class="token-string">"amqp://user:pass@rabbitmq:5672/"</span>
    )
    channel = <span class="token-keyword">await</span> connection.<span class="token-func">channel</span>()
    <span class="token-keyword">await</span> channel.<span class="token-func">set_qos</span>(prefetch_count=<span class="token-string">1</span>)  <span class="token-comment"># Procesar 1 tarea a la vez</span>

    queue = <span class="token-keyword">await</span> channel.<span class="token-func">declare_queue</span>(<span class="token-string">"agent-tasks"</span>, durable=<span class="token-string">True</span>)
    runner = <span class="token-func">AgentRunner</span>()

    <span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">process_message</span>(message: aio_pika.IncomingMessage):
        <span class="token-keyword">async with</span> message.<span class="token-func">process</span>():
            task = json.<span class="token-func">loads</span>(message.body)
            result = <span class="token-keyword">await</span> runner.<span class="token-func">execute</span>(
                task[<span class="token-string">"task_id"</span>],
                task[<span class="token-string">"prompt"</span>],
                task.<span class="token-func">get</span>(<span class="token-string">"context"</span>, {}),
            )
            <span class="token-comment"># Publicar resultado en cola de respuestas</span>
            <span class="token-keyword">await</span> channel.<span class="token-func">default_exchange</span>.publish(
                aio_pika.<span class="token-func">Message</span>(json.<span class="token-func">dumps</span>(result).encode()),
                routing_key=<span class="token-string">"agent-results"</span>,
            )

    <span class="token-keyword">await</span> queue.<span class="token-func">consume</span>(process_message)`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- K8s Deployment -->
  <section id="k8s-deployment">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">K8s Deployment</h2>
    <p>
      Desplegar agentes en Kubernetes permite escalar horizontalmente. Cada agente es un
      pod que consume tareas de la cola y puede autoescalar según la carga.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="yaml">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment"># agent-deployment.yaml</span>
<span class="token-keyword">apiVersion</span>: apps/v1
<span class="token-keyword">kind</span>: Deployment
<span class="token-keyword">metadata</span>:
  <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">ai-agent</span>
<span class="token-keyword">spec</span>:
  <span class="token-keyword">replicas</span>: <span class="token-string">3</span>
  <span class="token-keyword">selector</span>:
    <span class="token-keyword">matchLabels</span>:
      <span class="token-keyword">app</span>: <span class="token-string">ai-agent</span>
  <span class="token-keyword">template</span>:
    <span class="token-keyword">spec</span>:
      <span class="token-keyword">containers</span>:
        - <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">agent</span>
          <span class="token-keyword">image</span>: <span class="token-string">registry.io/ai-agent:1.0.0</span>
          <span class="token-keyword">resources</span>:
            <span class="token-keyword">requests</span>:
              <span class="token-keyword">cpu</span>: <span class="token-string">"500m"</span>
              <span class="token-keyword">memory</span>: <span class="token-string">"512Mi"</span>
            <span class="token-keyword">limits</span>:
              <span class="token-keyword">cpu</span>: <span class="token-string">"1000m"</span>
              <span class="token-keyword">memory</span>: <span class="token-string">"1Gi"</span>
          <span class="token-keyword">env</span>:
            - <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">LLM_API_KEY</span>
              <span class="token-keyword">valueFrom</span>:
                <span class="token-keyword">secretKeyRef</span>:
                  <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">llm-secrets</span>
                  <span class="token-keyword">key</span>: <span class="token-string">api-key</span>
            - <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">RABBITMQ_URL</span>
              <span class="token-keyword">value</span>: <span class="token-string">"amqp://user:pass@rabbitmq:5672/"</span>
          <span class="token-keyword">livenessProbe</span>:
            <span class="token-keyword">httpGet</span>:
              <span class="token-keyword">path</span>: <span class="token-string">/health</span>
              <span class="token-keyword">port</span>: <span class="token-string">8080</span>
---
<span class="token-comment"># HPA — Autoescalar basado en la longitud de la cola</span>
<span class="token-keyword">apiVersion</span>: autoscaling/v2
<span class="token-keyword">kind</span>: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
<span class="token-keyword">metadata</span>:
  <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">agent-hpa</span>
<span class="token-keyword">spec</span>:
  <span class="token-keyword">scaleTargetRef</span>:
    <span class="token-keyword">apiVersion</span>: <span class="token-string">apps/v1</span>
    <span class="token-keyword">kind</span>: <span class="token-string">Deployment</span>
    <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">ai-agent</span>
  <span class="token-keyword">minReplicas</span>: <span class="token-string">2</span>
  <span class="token-keyword">maxReplicas</span>: <span class="token-string">10</span>
  <span class="token-keyword">metrics</span>:
    - <span class="token-keyword">type</span>: <span class="token-string">Resource</span>
      <span class="token-keyword">resource</span>:
        <span class="token-keyword">name</span>: <span class="token-string">cpu</span>
        <span class="token-keyword">target</span>:
          <span class="token-keyword">type</span>: <span class="token-string">Utilization</span>
          <span class="token-keyword">averageUtilization</span>: <span class="token-string">70</span>`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <Callout type="tip" title="KEDA para queue-based scaling">
      Usa <strong>KEDA</strong> (Kubernetes Event-Driven Autoscaling) para escalar basado
      en la longitud de la cola RabbitMQ: más mensajes pendientes → más pods agente.
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- Observability -->
  <section id="observability">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Observability</h2>
    <p>
      Los agentes de IA necesitan observabilidad especial: además de métricas estándar,
      necesitamos tracking de <strong>tokens consumidos</strong>, <strong>latency por tool</strong>
      y <strong>trazas de reasoning</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="doc-table-wrapper custom-scroll">
      <table class="doc-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Métrica</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Descripción</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_tasks_total</code></td><td>Counter</td><td>Total de tareas procesadas</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_task_duration_seconds</code></td><td>Histogram</td><td>Duración de la ejecución completa</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_llm_tokens_total</code></td><td>Counter</td><td>Tokens consumidos (input + output)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_tool_calls_total</code></td><td>Counter</td><td>Llamadas por tool</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_errors_total</code></td><td>Counter</td><td>Errores por tipo</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">agent_iterations</code></td><td>Histogram</td><td>Número de pasos de reasoning por tarea</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <Callout type="info" title="Structured logging">
      Usa <strong>JSON logging</strong> para que Loki/EFK pueda filtrar por
      <code>task_id</code>, <code>agent_name</code>, <code>tool_name</code> y
      <code>llm_model</code>. Cada iteración del agente debe loguear su paso de
      reasoning para depuración.
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
</article>
